fault":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:49:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T08:30:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- since 4.0\r\n- available in 4.4.dev4\r\n- tested only for windows\n\n### System information\n\nWindows\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/editor/plugins/tiles/tile_set_atlas_source_editor.cpp#L742\r\n\r\nFor some reason, the string \"Physics Layer %d\" is not translated when the Editor is compiled. I tested in both Turkish and Spanish languages, both having a translation for it older than a year.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d949c458-1d3b-4b0c-9f76-ff4db0f7e61a)\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open the editor in a language other than English, start a new empty project\r\n- add a new TileMap or TileMapLayer\r\n- set a new TileSet\r\n- add a new Physics Layer\r\n- under TileSet editor, add a tile sheet, let it auto make an atlas\r\n- click on \"select\", select a tile\r\n- expand physics property to see this string not translated\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nsame as above","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos